        "raw": "[quote=\"waedens\"]\n\nHi All, Any information on plans for oversized villain cards for Wrath of the Cosmos and the WM? I am sure there are plans for them, just curious about what they are.Thanks!\n\n[/quote]\n\nThe current known answer is that Wrath is coming with the regular villain cards, they will have oversized cards (along with Wager Master, Skinwalker Gloomweaver and Spite, Agent of Gloom) when they release another oversized villain pack.\n\nEDIT: The oversized cards being standard in Vengance was a one time thing due to the special team battle feature and not the new standard for villain cards.\n",
